IMAPAccount icloud
Host imap.mail.me.com
User jkbresee@icloud.com
PassCmd "security find-generic-password -a jkbresee@icloud.com -s icloud-mbsync -w"
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore icloud-remote
Account icloud

MaildirStore icloud-local
Path ~/Mail/icloud/
Inbox ~/Mail/icloud/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel icloud
Far :icloud-remote:
Near :icloud-local:
Patterns * !"Deleted Messages" !"Junk"
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *